WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:16.700
This program is fiction and has no relation to any real person, organization, name, law, or location.

00:27.190 --> 00:28.980
<i>Here's a glimpse of my daily life</i>

00:29.360 --> 00:32.940
<i>since I arrived in Tokyo a few days ago.</i>

00:34.280 --> 00:34.950
Not good.

00:44.960 --> 00:47.130
Get that through your head.

00:47.630 --> 00:48.710
Hi, there.

00:48.880 --> 00:51.210
Don't touch anything with my name on it.

00:51.380 --> 00:52.260
Cheapskate.

00:52.420 --> 00:53.550
Come on, be nice.

00:52.420 --> 00:55.760
DRINKING YOGHURT - NINA

00:53.970 --> 00:56.380
It's to soak up the rest of the alcohol.

00:56.550 --> 00:57.260
You're dreaming.

00:57.550 --> 01:01.390
I asked you yesterday if you wanted me to get you some.

01:01.560 --> 01:03.270
Make the connection, I was drunk.

01:06.020 --> 01:08.400
So, anything new?

01:08.730 --> 01:09.480
Not a thing.

01:09.650 --> 01:13.820
I guess that's not how you get back a place you've given up.

01:13.990 --> 01:16.200
- What about work?
- Nothing there either.

01:16.360 --> 01:18.910
You know I've got plans today.

01:19.980 --> 01:23.100
yarinokoshita kodou ga kono yoru wo ootte

01:19.980 --> 01:23.100
This unfinished beat covers the night

01:25.320 --> 01:25.980
Embracing us before we're crushed

01:25.980 --> 01:27.900
tayorinakute mo ii sono te wo

01:25.980 --> 01:27.900
Even if your hand is unreliable

01:29.280 --> 01:30.700
That is your own hand

01:32.240 --> 01:33.530
There will be change if you just reach out

01:40.540 --> 01:43.290
Crying in a crowd with a voiceless voice

01:46.460 --> 01:46.460
Come morning, the footsteps drown out the voice

01:50.420 --> 01:51.670
No matter how much time passes, it never dries

01:51.670 --> 01:53.470
fuhaishita machi no doromizu ga tsumetai

01:51.670 --> 01:53.470
