01:59.100 --> 02:00.600
kyou datte ikiteyukunda

01:59.100 --> 02:00.600
We have to live through it

02:01.600 --> 02:03.900
kudaranai kedo shikatanai desho

02:01.600 --> 02:03.900
It may be dumb, but we have no choice

02:03.900 --> 02:06.560
bokura wa mou aruki hajimetanda

02:03.900 --> 02:06.560
We've already started walking

02:06.650 --> 02:09.820
uso mitai na baka mitai na

02:06.650 --> 02:09.820
It may seem unreal, it may seem stupid

02:09.820 --> 02:12.610
doushiyou mo nai bokura no machi

02:09.820 --> 02:12.610
This hopeless city of ours

02:12.610 --> 02:14.910
soredemo kono me de tashikani mietanda

02:12.610 --> 02:14.910
But I still saw it with my own eyes

02:14.910 --> 02:16.320
kono te de tashikani furetanda

02:14.910 --> 02:16.320
I touched it with these hands

02:16.320 --> 02:17.780
nee hora hora

02:16.320 --> 02:17.780
See? See?

02:17.780 --> 02:21.080
hora mata fuita baka mitaida

02:17.780 --> 02:21.080
See? There it goes again, it's so stupid

02:23.160 --> 02:23.920
Shine a light through the hopeless darkness

02:23.920 --> 02:24.750
yume janai douse owatteru machi datte

02:23.920 --> 02:24.750
